WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.649
Here's how a Title22 trainer code works, from your classroom to your commission.

00:05.999 --> 00:12.337
Trainers: on title-22.com, open For Trainers and tap Get your trainer code.

00:12.687 --> 00:16.592
Eli sets up your code with your rate and your students' trial length.

00:16.742 --> 00:20.690
You get a short link, easy to say in class or put on a slide.

00:21.040 --> 00:25.223
Students open your link and sign up with just an email. No card.

00:25.373 --> 00:31.795
Their trial is usually 90 days instead of 30, with a practice home of invented staff inside.

00:32.145 --> 00:35.624
Each account is linked to you from the moment it's created.

00:35.774 --> 00:40.511
Tip: students should sign up right after opening the link, in the same browser.

00:40.861 --> 00:47.369
When a facility linked to your code subscribes, you earn 20% of every payment, every month it stays.

00:47.519 --> 00:49.291
Eli pays you directly.

00:49.641 --> 00:56.917
Teaching with it? Sign up at title22.app, then ask Eli for classroom access. It never expires.

00:57.567 --> 01:02.505
Get your trainer code: hello@title-22.com
